  "description": "Pre-event baseline SkySat imagery over Savanna-la-Mar, Jamaica, acquired 2023-10-21 — the most recent cloud-free SkySat coverage of this location before Hurricane Melissa (~2 years prior), for before/after comparison. Parish capital of Westmoreland on Jamaica's southwest coast. 22 scenes; each Item carries the available visual and pansharpened COGs plus usable-data-mask (UDM2/UDM).",
